[h2]Magazine Repack[/h2]
Open your inventory and press [b]Repack Magazines[/b] to move rounds between partly filled magazines of the same type. It works across your uniform, vest and backpack and with compatible magazines already loaded in your weapon. A partly filled magazine in your weapon is swapped for a full one when possible. Grenades, rockets and single-round magazines are excluded. Press the button again or close the inventory to stop; completed transfers are kept.

The server can set the time per round (0.12 seconds by default), whether AI repack instantly while out of combat, and the interval between AI checks (60 seconds by default).

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]Magazine Repack[/b] module to use it in that scenario. A trigger can turn the module on and off. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → Magazine Repack[/b], check [b]Enable Magazine Repack[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

